full-query: "An AWS Chatbot client is configured in your AWS account that can send notifications to the Slack workspace of your team. The team starts to manage Git repositories in AWS CodeCommit. In order to monitor important changes of source code, you need to set up a rule to notify users whenever a pull request is created and merged in the repositories. The notifications should be sent to the Slack channel through the AWS Chatbot client. How would you create the notification?"
